---
id: cottage-cheese-clementine-bowl
title: Cottage Cheese with Clementines
category: snacks
meal_role: fruit_bowl

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 225

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Spoon @cottage-cheese-2pct{1/2%cup} into a small bowl.

Peel @clementines{2}, pull them into segments, and cut each segment in half. Scatter them over the cottage cheese, with any juice from the board, and serve chilled.
